    "每条活动右侧有一个圆圈按钮，办妥后点一下，圆圈会变成绿色勾选状态，同时取消该活动的后续提醒通知。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each event has a circle button on the right. Tap it when you're done: it turns into a green check and that event's reminders are cancelled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每条活动右侧有一个圆圈按钮，办妥后点一下，圆圈会变成绿色勾选状态，同时取消该活动的后续提醒通知。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
